OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after teenage girl
OL,4,Araped in park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his late teens has been
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of raping a
OL,8,Fteenage girl in a park, police have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe attack happened at about 11:30 GMT
OL,12,Fin Parade Gardens in Bath, Somerset.
OL,14,FAvon and Somerset Police said they were
OL,15,Fsupporting the victim and forensic and
OL,16,FCCTV investigations were ongoing.
