OL,4,Araped in park
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Insp Dudley Bond said: "A key
OL,7,Fpriority for us is supporting the young
OL,8,Fvictim, and ensuring she receives the
OL,9,Fspecialist care and assistance she
OL,10,Fneeds both in the short-term and going
OL,11,Fforward."
